anscript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q1","e":"app","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Adam Foroughi","x":"We are already seeing advertisers use AI agents to manage their marketing spend, and we are building Axon to be natively accessible to those agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/applovin-app-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q1","e":"app","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Adam Foroughi","x":"Between self-serve access in June, our AI-powered ad creative tools and agent-compatible infrastructure, we are building a system where an advertiser can onboard, generate high-performing ads and scale campaigns profitably without ever needing to talk to a human.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/applovin-app-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q1","e":"app","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Robert Coolbrith","x":"On the direct billing or web shops, obviously, there's the cost savings side of the equation, but we also hear some developers talk about that as an interesting new surface area for data capture and remarketing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/applovin-app-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q1","e":"app","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Adam Foroughi","x":"Look, right now, a lot of the Vibe coded stuff in the world is quite a bit of slop more than substance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/applovin-app-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q1","e":"app","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Adam Foroughi","x":"Anyone could integrate with our mediation solution using the popular Vibe coding tools today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/applovin-app-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"APP 2026 Q3","e":"app","d":"2026-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Adam 